## Anti-patterns

- ❌ Ending a task turn without updating `todo.md` + `changelog.md`
- ❌ Linear Done with no changelog row
- ❌ Score without dimension table
- ❌ “Post-merge PASS” while PR is OPEN
- ❌ Todo/changelog/ledger out of sync
- ❌ Shorthand titles in changelog (`RENT-021`) while todo has full Linear title
